safix::vault_root_without_declaration

  × SAFIX_VAULT_ROOT names /srv/vault, but flake.safix.vault is not declared.
  │ Declare flake.safix.vault or unset SAFIX_VAULT_ROOT. A vault whose
  │ declaration was removed without first running the rollback is recovered
  │ the same way: re-declare flake.safix.vault and run `safix fix --vault-
  │ rollback` before removing it again.
